<div class="text-center py-5">
  <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_NAME", "VirtuesGarden Demo") %></h1>
  <p class="lead text-muted mt-2"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_TAGLINE", "") %></p>
  <p class="text-muted mx-auto mt-3" style="max-width: 640px;">
    A child&rsquo;s year is pieced together from a dozen places: a class here, a grandmother there, a neighbour who
    welds. Tell us what one child loves, what you hope this season gives them, and what your community already
    offers. You get five to eight aims across academics, character, practical skill, service and experience, each
    matched to something you listed or named honestly as a gap. No tests, no scores, and nobody but you decides
    where your child goes.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4 d-flex justify-content-center gap-3">
    <% if signed_in? %>
      <%= link_to "Go to my learners", learners_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
    <% else %>
      <%= link_to "Try it free", sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
      <%= link_to "Sign in", sign_in_path, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg" %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>

<hr class="my-5 opacity-25">

<div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 880px;">
  <h2 class="h5 text-muted text-center mb-4">Example &mdash; a fictional family in a homeschool co-op</h2>

  <div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body small">
      <p class="mb-1"><span class="text-muted">Learner:</span> Wren, 9 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
        <span class="text-muted">Interests:</span> draws birds, takes apart old radios, wants to bake bread on her own</p>
      <p class="mb-0"><span class="text-muted">Offerings:</span> Saturday bread class at St. Brigid&rsquo;s hall (ages 8&ndash;12),
        nature journaling walks at Linden Creek (ages 7&ndash;11)</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 aim-card"><div class="card-body">
        <p class="mb-1"><span class="badge area-badge area-practical_skill">Practical skill</span></p>
        <h3 class="h6 mb-2">Bake a loaf from start to finish</h3>
        <p class="small mb-0"><span class="badge match-badge">Match</span> Saturday bread class at St. Brigid&rsquo;s hall (ages 8&ndash;12)</p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 aim-card"><div class="card-body">
        <p class="mb-1"><span class="badge area-badge area-academics">Academics</span></p>
        <h3 class="h6 mb-2">Name twenty birds at the creek by their song or shape</h3>
        <p class="small mb-0"><span class="badge match-badge">Match</span> Nature journaling walks at Linden Creek (ages 7&ndash;11)</p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 aim-card"><div class="card-body">
        <p class="mb-1"><span class="badge area-badge area-experience">Experience</span></p>
        <h3 class="h6 mb-2">Open up an old radio with an adult and find what each part does</h3>
        <p class="small mb-0"><span class="badge gap-badge">Gap</span> <span class="text-muted">Nothing listed offers this yet</span></p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 aim-card"><div class="card-body">
        <p class="mb-1"><span class="badge area-badge area-service">Service</span></p>
        <h3 class="h6 mb-2">Bring a loaf she baked to a neighbour who lives alone</h3>
        <p class="small mb-0"><span class="badge gap-badge">Gap</span> <span class="text-muted">Nothing listed offers this yet</span></p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="small text-muted mb-0">
    <strong>A gap is a to-do for the community,</strong> not a shortfall in the child: &ldquo;An adult who repairs
    radios or small electronics could open one up with two or three children, with a second adult present.&rdquo;
  </p>

  <p class="text-center text-muted small mt-4">
    AI-generated. A starting point for a guardian to edit, not an assessment: it never tests, scores, ranks or
    diagnoses a child.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="text-center mt-5 pb-4">
  <% unless signed_in? %>
    <%= link_to "Plan a season for your own child &rarr;".html_safe, sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
  <% end %>
  <div class="mt-3 text-muted small">
    Open source &middot;
    <a href="https://virtuesgarden.com" class="text-muted">VirtuesGarden</a>
  </div>
</div>
